@startuml
<style>
root {
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 13
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  LineColor #555555
}
title {
  FontSize 16
  FontStyle bold
  FontColor #1A1A2E
}
arrow {
  LineColor #4A90D9
  FontColor #333333
  FontSize 11
}
actor {
  BackGroundColor #08427B
  LineColor #4A90D9
  FontColor #FFFFFF
}
participant {
  BackGroundColor #EEF4FB
  LineColor #4A90D9
  FontColor #1A1A2E
}
database {
  BackGroundColor #FFF3E0
  LineColor #F5A623
  FontColor #1A1A2E
}
note {
  BackGroundColor #FFFDE7
  LineColor #F9A825
  FontColor #1A1A2E
}
</style>

title VPass 日常自动填充

actor 用户 as User
participant 网页 as Web
participant 浏览器扩展 as Extension
participant "本地安全客户端" as Client
participant "可验证状态 / 日志" as State
database 同步存储层 as Storage

User -> Web : 打开登录页面
Web -> Extension : 当前顶层 Origin
Extension -> Client : 账号选择 + Origin + nonce
Client -> Client : RouteMap → CredentialID
Client -> State : 解析当前状态
State --> Client : Descriptor + ProofBundle
Client -> Client : L1～L5 验证
Client -> Storage : 获取当前 hash 的 envelope
Storage --> Client : 密文对象
Client -> Client : 版本 / hash / OriginBinding / AEAD 验证
Client --> Extension : 一次性密码句柄
Extension -> Client : 消费句柄
Client --> Extension : 仅本次填充值
Extension -> Web : 自动填充

note over Client,Storage
  日常路径不等待链、VRF 或 SCOPE-ZK
end note
@enduml
